      "text": {
        "en": "Customers consistently praise the shop staff for their practical advice, patience, and honesty. Reviewers mention that the team takes time to guide families through care requirements without pushing sales. While one client noted a lack of communication after an issue arose, the overwhelming majority describe trustworthy and friendly guidance."
      }
    },
