      "title": {
        "en": "Extensive selection and welcoming shop"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Shoppers describe the store as an engaging destination featuring a wide assortment of reptiles, aquatics, birds, and small pets alongside specialised terrariums. Visitors appreciate having access to a dedicated independent pet shop in the Cork area, remarking on the tidy displays and enjoyable atmosphere during family visits."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Care for reptiles and pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many reviewers note that the animals on display appear well looked after and that staff demonstrate genuine concern for creature wellbeing. Buyers of parrots, chameleons, and fish report thriving pets and clear husbandry tips. One reviewer reported an unfortunate loss of a rabbit shortly after purchase, though others report healthy animals."
      }
    }
